'''Metal Core Barrier''' (Japanese: '''メタルコアバリア''' ''Metal Core Barrier'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=If this card is attached to 1 of your Pokémon, discard it at the end of your opponent's turn.
The {{e|Metal}} Pokémon this card is attached to takes −50 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

