==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Metal Core Barrier}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but reduces damage by 50 instead of 70. 
===Origin===
*This card's uncommon illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Metal Core Barrier|180}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.

